Química geral no laboratório — Marcela Boroski, organizer (@gc-unila: 0, is #reference, #part-of @gc-sources) { r_48YEN2SA34DW0FPCSTMVTW3CTD
Marcela Boroski, organizadora. Química geral no laboratório. 1ª edição. Editora Universitária da UNILA, 2022. Português. ISBN 978-65-86342-30-7. [Publisher, metadata, licence, and download](https://editora.unila.edu.br/edunila/catalog/book/73) · [Authorized PDF](https://editora.unila.edu.br/edunila/catalog/download/73/115/490?inline=1).

Read the complete manual before designing the sustained practical programme. Use the named activities on laboratory techniques, reactions, solutions, stoichiometry, standardization, equilibrium, thermochemistry, kinetics, and electrochemistry alongside the corresponding theory. The catalogue gives 97 pages; the available file has 99 PDF pages. Match the printed activity headings rather than assuming file-page numbering.

The publisher declares CC BY 4.0. Preserve organizer/contributor and component notices when reusing material. Practical activities require the appropriate supervised laboratory, equipment, preparation, waste management, and current procedure-specific assessment; reading the manual does not provide those physical arrangements. Publisher metadata, PDF availability, and licence checked on 29 October 2026. Reference only; no PDF or experiment dataset is stored here.

